# Simple-Property · git connection (Deposit Desk)

**Repo:** `SP-Q26/Simple-Property` · work from **`~/SPQ/simple-property`** (or standalone clone), not SPQ `weweb-export`.

## Canonical remote (HTTPS breaks Terminal)

```text
git@github.com:SP-Q26/Simple-Property.git
```

Never set `https://SP-Q26@github.com/...`. Do not use org name as HTTPS username.

## Agent duty (push / fetch)

1. Before push: `npm run audit:git` — must show **main matches origin/main** after push.
2. Shell git over SSH needs **`required_permissions: ["all"]`** (sandbox blocks fetch/push).
3. Commits: repo-local `S.P.` + `*@users.noreply.github.com` only.
4. First-time orphan replace: `git push --force-with-lease origin main` once only when audit warns orphan.

